Mexico flag SVG
---------------
The file `assets/bandera.svg` contains embedded metadata identifying the work
as "mexico", uploaded to Openclipart on 2011-02-16, with source
http://openclipart.org/detail/119479/mexico-by-anonymous and a public-domain
dedication. Creator metadata: Anonymous; original uploader: Cezary Biele.

Basemap services
----------------
The interactive map requests raster tiles from CARTO and displays attribution
to OpenStreetMap contributors and CARTO. Use of those hosted services remains
subject to their respective terms.

Excluded country geometry
-------------------------
The private source previously contained a file byte-for-byte identical to blob
`afdfc39993bd6107d26050fe4e8ade36ce08b871` from
https://github.com/johan/world.geo.json. That upstream README describes the
dataset's legal status as uncertain, so the file is intentionally excluded from
this public distribution.

Government and international data
---------------------------------
The project references public information from Banco de México, Cámara de
Diputados, Diario Oficial de la Federación, Secretaría de Economía/SNICE,
VUCEM, SAT, ANAM, and World Bank/WITS. Those sources retain their own legal
status and terms. Attribution does not imply endorsement by any authority.
